WEBVTT

00:00:14.978 --> 00:00:22.044
I'll never be easily loved...

00:00:22.219 --> 00:00:29.250
Am I just too clumsy?

00:00:29.893 --> 00:00:36.458
That girl who looks good in pink...

00:00:37.100 --> 00:00:43.198
Is that who you want?

00:00:43.840 --> 00:00:47.799
Is red not good enough?

00:00:47.911 --> 00:00:54.874
The rabbit with red eyes runs away.

00:00:54.985 --> 00:01:02.221
Even though I loved you so much...

00:01:02.325 --> 00:01:10.325
If I'm sad, I'm going to die.

00:01:10.500 --> 00:01:16.997
The rabbit that you like...

00:01:17.641 --> 00:01:24.547
...isn't on the moon.
It's just a rabbit...

00:01:32.422 --> 00:01:35.084
Anotsu Kagehisa...

00:01:36.459 --> 00:01:40.089
You're no longer part
of the Mutenichi-ryu.

00:01:40.664 --> 00:01:44.601
You're on your way
to becoming just like us.

00:01:51.107 --> 00:01:52.097
Wind

00:01:55.245 --> 00:01:56.713
Tea's ready.

00:01:57.180 --> 00:01:58.739
That's not it...

00:01:59.916 --> 00:02:02.044
I'm gonna leave it here.

00:02:08.725 --> 00:02:11.922
Something's not right.

00:02:13.563 --> 00:02:17.761
That's unusual, you handing
off a job to someone else.

00:02:19.002 --> 00:02:20.629
What a messed up kid.

00:02:20.737 --> 00:02:22.603
Don't underestimate him.

00:02:22.706 --> 00:02:26.665
He's the only kid who went up
against the Hundred-man Slayer...

00:02:26.776 --> 00:02:29.541
...and lived to talk about it.

00:02:31.514 --> 00:02:32.709
Tai?

00:02:33.950 --> 00:02:35.850
This is for you.

00:02:44.327 --> 00:02:47.058
You take care then, Oren.

00:02:51.134 --> 00:02:53.728
I'll come visit once in a while.

00:02:53.837 --> 00:02:55.430
Okay!

00:02:59.142 --> 00:03:01.406
Oren, you have a customer!

00:03:03.747 --> 00:03:04.924
Okay!

00:03:04.948 --> 00:03:06.643
Itto-ryu

00:03:08.284 --> 00:03:09.911
There you are, sir.

00:03:10.553 --> 00:03:11.486
What is it?

00:03:11.588 --> 00:03:14.523
A courier was here,
and he brought this...

00:03:16.292 --> 00:03:18.158
The Shingyoto-ryu...

00:03:18.962 --> 00:03:20.657
What is that?

00:03:24.768 --> 00:03:26.736
If you'll excuse me...

00:03:28.471 --> 00:03:31.907
| never suspected there
was a school in this land...

00:03:32.442 --> 00:03:35.241
...that walked the same
path as our Itto-ryu.

00:03:49.526 --> 00:03:51.153
What's the matter?

00:03:58.001 --> 00:04:00.629
I'll play a song for you. Come here.

00:04:06.509 --> 00:04:09.501
The flow...

00:04:09.612 --> 00:04:17.612
Where you descend
after being swept away.

00:04:23.026 --> 00:04:31.026
This is the other side
of the River Styx.

00:04:36.773 --> 00:04:39.242
It really is unusual.

00:04:40.710 --> 00:04:45.841
That you would hand a job off
to anyone, that is, much less Shira.

00:04:46.249 --> 00:04:48.946
Do you remember the girl?

00:04:49.619 --> 00:04:50.450
Pardon?

00:04:50.553 --> 00:04:51.679
You know.

00:04:51.788 --> 00:04:53.222
Oh, that one!

00:04:53.323 --> 00:04:56.623
The girl who pigged out
on zenzai and got heartburn.

00:04:56.726 --> 00:04:59.787
What, is something
going on with her?

00:04:59.896 --> 00:05:03.958
It's just that when
| see someone like her...

00:05:04.067 --> 00:05:07.128
...| start questioning what I'm doing.

00:05:08.938 --> 00:05:10.667
Oh, I see.

00:05:11.441 --> 00:05:14.240
You're totally clueless, aren't you?

00:05:14.744 --> 00:05:15.768
Yeah.

00:05:16.613 --> 00:05:18.604
That's just as well.

00:05:19.182 --> 00:05:21.879
But you handed off the job...

00:05:22.418 --> 00:05:25.877
...50 why are we still
out here dressed like this?

00:05:26.856 --> 00:05:29.882
Because of the person
| handed it off to.

00:05:31.728 --> 00:05:32.991
You're late.

00:05:34.230 --> 00:05:35.595
How'd it go?

00:05:35.698 --> 00:05:37.029
I missed him.

00:05:37.300 --> 00:05:38.790
He'd already left.

00:05:39.569 --> 00:05:43.403
Even if we want to go after him,
we don't know which way to go.

00:05:43.840 --> 00:05:45.035
Oh, well...

00:05:45.375 --> 00:05:47.776
It's not a rush job...

00:05:47.877 --> 00:05:51.279
...50 let's just relax
and take our time with it, Hyakurin.

00:05:54.851 --> 00:05:56.080
You killed her?

00:05:56.186 --> 00:05:57.153
Yeah.

00:05:57.854 --> 00:06:00.152
Shira, you swine...

00:06:00.623 --> 00:06:05.754
The prostitute I first called on
wouldn't talk, so... you know.

00:06:07.063 --> 00:06:10.033
Why are you looking at me like that?

00:06:10.500 --> 00:06:14.368
Why should you care
about a leg-spreader or two?

00:06:15.538 --> 00:06:17.768
We aren't amateurs...

00:06:18.474 --> 00:06:23.139
...and aren't we supposed to keep
the job first and foremost in our minds?

00:06:24.581 --> 00:06:28.950
There's no need to quibble over
how each of our jobs is done.

00:06:40.263 --> 00:06:44.757
|-I want...

00:06:45.802 --> 00:06:48.635
...to see Tai.

00:07:10.660 --> 00:07:13.493
You cry easily enough as it is.

00:07:13.596 --> 00:07:16.588
Why not just get
some sleep at night?

00:07:17.667 --> 00:07:20.227
Let's just stay like this for a while.

00:07:20.336 --> 00:07:25.570
Otherwise, I feel like
my heart's going to fall apart.

00:07:28.511 --> 00:07:32.607
What Makie said to me
is stuck somewhere in my heart.

00:07:33.316 --> 00:07:35.614
Indeed, to the uninvolved...

00:07:35.718 --> 00:07:39.586
...revenge is just pointless,
unproductive murder.

00:07:41.057 --> 00:07:45.551
It's not that I don't
understand what he's trying to do.

00:07:46.729 --> 00:07:51.530
But even after he said
what he said to me...

00:07:51.868 --> 00:07:56.863
Where am I supposed
to go with these feelings?

00:07:58.474 --> 00:08:00.966
You ran into Anotsu?

00:08:03.212 --> 00:08:04.202
Well...

00:08:06.115 --> 00:08:08.675
I've said this to you before...

00:08:09.619 --> 00:08:14.580
Are the lives of your parents
that cheap in your eyes?

00:08:18.061 --> 00:08:24.125
| don't know what he said, but can a kid
who's got her hands full with herself...

00:08:24.233 --> 00:08:27.828
...afford to be swayed
by her enemy's arguments?

00:08:27.937 --> 00:08:29.371
| know that.

00:08:29.472 --> 00:08:32.567
I'm ashamed of myself.

00:08:34.210 --> 00:08:38.670
When I was fourteen,
| wouldn't have hesitated at all.

00:08:39.982 --> 00:08:41.916
It's been two years since then.

00:08:42.018 --> 00:08:45.249
I've been careless these two years...

00:08:46.122 --> 00:08:49.183
...and I've become such a coward.

00:08:49.692 --> 00:08:55.187
That I'm comparing the lives of
my parents with what he said to me...

00:08:56.666 --> 00:08:58.828
| can't believe it.

00:09:00.670 --> 00:09:03.264
No kidding. I'm shocked.

00:09:06.476 --> 00:09:07.944
Are you awake?

00:09:10.146 --> 00:09:13.411
Maybe it's about
the right time to call it quits.

00:09:13.683 --> 00:09:16.277
Kuroi Sabato,
who killed your father...

00:09:16.386 --> 00:09:22.382
...and Kawakami Ara ya and Shizuma
Eiku, who tormented your mother...

00:09:22.492 --> 00:09:24.187
...are all dead.

00:09:24.293 --> 00:09:25.419
Maniji...

00:09:27.697 --> 00:09:31.031
There's always
the choice to end it here.

00:09:31.968 --> 00:09:34.801
Well, I'm not
the one who decides that.

00:09:34.904 --> 00:09:37.771
It's up to you, Rin.

00:09:42.979 --> 00:09:44.003
Infinity.

00:09:45.114 --> 00:09:46.013
Infinity.

00:09:58.561 --> 00:10:00.393
What's this?

00:10:01.397 --> 00:10:05.891
The guy who killed Oren was
wearing a kimono with that design.

00:10:08.237 --> 00:10:11.696
It's yours. Do what you want with it.

00:10:12.508 --> 00:10:16.638
Hey, why lay her body
out here of all places?

00:10:16.746 --> 00:10:19.272
Don't you feel bad for her?

00:10:19.382 --> 00:10:22.010
| chose the coldest place.

00:10:22.919 --> 00:10:27.447
Because I didn't know when
a certain idiot was coming back.

00:10:27.990 --> 00:10:33.292
| didn't want to show you
her body once it was rotting away.

00:10:35.164 --> 00:10:39.397
This probably wouldn't have
happened if you hadn't left.

00:10:40.236 --> 00:10:43.968
Oren just wanted
to be with you forever.

00:10:44.907 --> 00:10:47.672
It really was just that simple.

00:10:48.678 --> 00:10:53.445
Was that dream so extravagant?
Was it asking too much?

00:10:53.549 --> 00:10:58.453
So what if you're a swordsman?
What did all that skill do for her?

00:10:59.655 --> 00:11:05.185
In the end, all people with swords
know how to do is walk over others.

00:11:05.728 --> 00:11:08.595
| thought you knew
that better than anyone!

00:11:08.965 --> 00:11:10.729
You son of a bitch...

00:11:10.833 --> 00:11:12.801
Never come here again!

00:11:26.015 --> 00:11:27.107
Manji?

00:11:28.217 --> 00:11:29.343
Manji?

00:11:32.221 --> 00:11:34.087
It's been a while.

00:11:36.058 --> 00:11:38.823
I've decided to go on a journey.

00:11:39.028 --> 00:11:41.793
But there's no actual destination.

00:11:42.064 --> 00:11:47.969
I'm a priestess, so it's a journey of
training to save the souls of the lost.

00:11:48.704 --> 00:11:54.006
| thought I would bring him
along with me in my travels...

00:11:54.410 --> 00:11:57.573
But I guess Manji isn't here.

00:11:58.581 --> 00:12:01.949
You're going to take Manji with you?

00:12:02.652 --> 00:12:08.989
That's if he abandons the sword,
shaves his head, and becomes a priest.

00:12:10.393 --> 00:12:16.856
Of course, if he wishes to stay
with you, I would not force him.

00:12:18.434 --> 00:12:22.928
Manji might say
he's going to go with you.

00:12:26.442 --> 00:12:29.673
It's because I keep wavering.

00:12:32.582 --> 00:12:35.279
I'll take you some place special.

00:12:37.086 --> 00:12:39.919
Here, Manji!

00:12:41.824 --> 00:12:45.385
It looks great on you, Big Brother.

00:12:45.661 --> 00:12:47.220
Y-Yeah...

00:12:47.563 --> 00:12:50.555
His sister died because of him...

00:12:50.666 --> 00:12:55.832
...and like a child, he said he'd kill
a thousand villains as a tribute to her.

00:12:55.972 --> 00:13:02.002
Somehow I understand
the feeling underlying those words.

00:13:02.545 --> 00:13:03.603
What is it?

00:13:03.713 --> 00:13:04.737
Doubt.

00:13:05.815 --> 00:13:06.611
Doubt?

00:13:07.216 --> 00:13:09.776
He isn't sure what to do.

00:13:09.885 --> 00:13:11.853
But that too is...

00:13:12.622 --> 00:13:17.617
Rather, maybe that itself is the course
the heavens have laid out for him.

00:13:18.361 --> 00:13:21.228
Manji is just like me...

00:13:22.064 --> 00:13:24.328
No, that's different.

00:13:25.701 --> 00:13:29.160
Yours is not doubt. It's perplexity.

00:13:29.805 --> 00:13:35.107
You lost the way you should go, and
your heart is simply in vain disorder.

00:13:35.945 --> 00:13:40.610
What divides doubt
and perplexity is a firm strength.

00:13:41.183 --> 00:13:43.515
Manji is a strong man.

00:13:43.786 --> 00:13:46.380
Having that strength
is what first allows you...

00:13:46.489 --> 00:13:49.948
...to be in doubt
over which path to follow.

00:13:52.194 --> 00:13:55.824
You don't need
a reason. Just live strong.

00:13:55.931 --> 00:13:59.299
Then your path
will open up on its own.

00:14:02.271 --> 00:14:03.636
That idiot...

00:14:03.739 --> 00:14:06.367
Where the hell did she go?

00:14:06.909 --> 00:14:08.206
Manji!

00:14:09.445 --> 00:14:11.436
Where the hell were you?

00:14:11.914 --> 00:14:14.144
| was with Yaobikuni.

00:14:14.684 --> 00:14:16.482
The old lady, huh?

00:14:16.585 --> 00:14:19.179
She said to give you her regards.

00:14:20.322 --> 00:14:25.192
Come on, let's eat
quickly and get to training.

00:14:26.262 --> 00:14:30.165
Did that old woman
get inside your head?

00:14:30.599 --> 00:14:33.569
Manju
Dumplings

00:14:35.838 --> 00:14:37.806
Food

00:14:38.674 --> 00:14:42.008
The wind, eh?
Looks like it's started to blow...

00:14:43.679 --> 00:14:47.673
So a school that shares
the motive of the Itto-ryu...

00:14:47.783 --> 00:14:50.343
...would like to join you.

00:14:51.120 --> 00:14:52.417
Indeed.

00:14:52.521 --> 00:14:55.980
Therefore I intend
to travel to Kaga soon.

00:14:56.492 --> 00:15:01.430
During my absence, another would
serve in my place. Is this acceptable?

00:15:02.331 --> 00:15:04.390
It will have to be.

00:15:04.500 --> 00:15:08.232
That is good news for myself as well.

00:15:08.738 --> 00:15:13.266
The more who would reform
the obsolescing way of the sword...

00:15:13.375 --> 00:15:15.673
...in this time of peace the better.

00:15:16.579 --> 00:15:21.483
If there are any good
candidates at this Shingyotoryu...

00:15:21.751 --> 00:15:27.121
...please recommend them
as instructors for our Koukenjyo.

00:15:27.690 --> 00:15:29.749
| will keep that in mind.

00:15:39.168 --> 00:15:41.034
Continue surveillance.

00:15:41.137 --> 00:15:42.229
Yes, sir.

00:15:54.850 --> 00:15:56.079
What's wrong?

00:15:57.086 --> 00:16:00.056
It looked like
something's bothering you.

00:16:00.156 --> 00:16:04.389
Just a little.
| was thinking of my dead child.

00:16:05.127 --> 00:16:10.190
No need to lie. If you don't want
to tell me, don't say anything.

00:16:10.299 --> 00:16:12.529
You're the one who asked.

00:16:12.635 --> 00:16:14.160
Indeed I was.

00:16:14.270 --> 00:16:18.707
Man, I can't stand guys
who wear colored glasses.

00:16:19.675 --> 00:16:24.841
You can't tell what they're thinking
even if you look them in the eye.

00:16:35.024 --> 00:16:36.219
He's here!

00:16:39.628 --> 00:16:46.125
Hear me, you who left no corpse
despite being given the death penalty.

00:16:46.602 --> 00:16:48.730
The shogunate's enemy, the Itto-ryu...

00:16:48.838 --> 00:16:51.864
...believes blindly in
the power of the sword...

00:16:51.974 --> 00:16:56.138
...and tries to create many warlike
swordsmen in this era of peace.

00:16:56.245 --> 00:17:00.944
A superb chance to eradicate
them has finally arrived.

00:17:01.750 --> 00:17:06.688
Soon, Anotsu Kagehisa
will leave Edo to go to Kaga.

00:17:07.423 --> 00:17:10.415
That is the time I shall move.

00:17:12.328 --> 00:17:13.887
You...

00:17:16.165 --> 00:17:18.327
...will go claim Anotsu's head.

00:17:21.437 --> 00:17:23.906
The wind has blown.

00:17:28.210 --> 00:17:30.110
Something occurred to me.

00:17:30.813 --> 00:17:34.010
Even if the only one
| hate is Anotsu Kagehisa...

00:17:34.650 --> 00:17:38.609
...If someone gets
in my way, I'll fight them too.

00:17:39.188 --> 00:17:44.183
Even if they're someone's
parent or sibling or husband.

00:17:45.561 --> 00:17:51.227
If I think about selfish things,
| start losing track of what I should do.

00:17:52.067 --> 00:17:54.832
When I left the dojo...

00:17:54.937 --> 00:17:59.238
...I had decided,
"I can die so long as I get my revenge."

00:18:00.276 --> 00:18:04.235
But you know, dying is
such an easy thing to do.

00:18:05.080 --> 00:18:10.917
If I just chose to die, what would
the people I walked all over think?

00:18:12.187 --> 00:18:17.990
If you can wake up every day, eat and
sleep, have no desire or ambition...

00:18:18.093 --> 00:18:20.755
...and keep smiling even
when others trample you...

00:18:21.764 --> 00:18:24.062
Unless you're that kind of person...

00:18:24.166 --> 00:18:27.796
.| guess everyone has
somebody hate them sometime.

00:18:29.405 --> 00:18:33.000
If you really want to not
be hated by anyone...

00:18:33.842 --> 00:18:37.107
...you can't even fart
on the side of the street.

00:18:37.212 --> 00:18:40.671
All you're doing
is trying to avenge your parents.

00:18:41.483 --> 00:18:44.475
You should walk around
with your head held high.

00:18:44.586 --> 00:18:46.554
Yes, you're right.

00:18:47.056 --> 00:18:50.754
My parents' lives are important to me.

00:18:51.460 --> 00:18:54.122
Far more than the lives
of complete strangers.

00:18:56.031 --> 00:18:58.898
Maybe I shouldn't have said that.

00:19:00.235 --> 00:19:02.966
Of course you should, stupid.

00:19:05.174 --> 00:19:07.336
Okay, I made my decision!

00:19:08.577 --> 00:19:13.037
Manji, I want to become
at least a little closer to you...

00:19:13.415 --> 00:19:17.716
...50 I'll do my best
to eat this grilled frog whole.

00:19:28.964 --> 00:19:34.300
Manji, I want to become
stronger, so don't go easy on me.

00:19:35.504 --> 00:19:37.131
You said so yourself.

00:19:37.239 --> 00:19:41.801
If it's not practice, you have to attack
each other until you puke blood.

00:19:42.644 --> 00:19:46.581
I'm really in the mood
to make some bruises right now.

00:19:47.950 --> 00:19:52.114
Idiot, if I don't go easy
oh you, you're gonna cry.

00:19:53.489 --> 00:19:54.684
| won't.

00:19:55.224 --> 00:19:58.125
| don't care if you beat me senseless.

00:19:58.227 --> 00:20:00.628
But I'll attack you really hard too.

00:20:01.930 --> 00:20:02.988
| see it!

00:20:09.071 --> 00:20:10.004
Oren...

00:20:19.948 --> 00:20:23.384
Miss Rin, are you able to defeat me?

00:20:50.312 --> 00:20:52.144
You should die like a bug too.

00:21:02.758 --> 00:21:04.749
Come, I'll destroy you.

00:21:14.069 --> 00:21:15.298
Goodbye.

00:21:30.152 --> 00:21:31.278
Let's go.

00:21:38.594 --> 00:21:39.857
It's complete...

00:21:41.630 --> 00:21:44.258
Dad, the Nagasaki
store owner's here.

00:21:44.366 --> 00:21:46.528
Okay, be right there.

00:22:00.415 --> 00:22:01.405
Hey.

00:22:02.851 --> 00:22:04.148
Rin.

00:22:09.158 --> 00:22:10.387
Rin?

00:22:11.093 --> 00:22:12.857
Not done yet...

00:22:15.731 --> 00:22:17.529
Come on, let's eat.

00:22:25.541 --> 00:22:31.446
Sadly, I awakened...

00:22:31.547 --> 00:22:39.420
Overflowing reality is just...

00:22:40.322 --> 00:22:45.385
...more of the empty lies.

00:22:49.431 --> 00:22:57.431
To be honest, I have
to get ready for the next one.

00:22:59.107 --> 00:23:05.171
The morning slides
in from the window.

00:23:05.480 --> 00:23:12.750
Regardless of what
I see, I remember.

00:23:12.854 --> 00:23:16.119
| remember...

00:23:16.258 --> 00:23:22.595
The unchanging wind always...

00:23:22.698 --> 00:23:29.001
...just said this as it passed by...

00:23:29.104 --> 00:23:37.104
"What's needed for
this endless journey?”

00:23:49.925 --> 00:23:52.792
Where should I go?
